WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:07.215
The giant worms looked at Ringo, Vern, and Bot.

2
00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:17.629
"Let's get out of here!" Vern said.

3
00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:22.021
But the worms moved closer.

4
00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:24.637
Ringo started to climb.

5
00:00:24.638 --> 00:00:26.915
A worm grabbed his foot!

6
00:00:26.916 --> 00:00:33.042
"Ahh!" Ringo cried.

7
00:00:33.043 --> 00:00:37.415
"Let go of him!" Vern kicked the worm.

8
00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:40.782
Hiss! The worm wiggled.

9
00:00:40.783 --> 00:00:44.558
Then another worm grabbed Vern!

10
00:00:44.559 --> 00:00:46.749
Ringo thought fast.

11
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.046
"Heat poles keep worms away.

12
00:00:49.047 --> 00:00:51.541
Bot, can you make heat?"

13
00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:55.625
Bing! "Yes!"

14
00:00:55.626 --> 00:00:59.085
Bot started to blow heat.

15
00:00:59.086 --> 00:01:02.897
One worm still held Ringo's foot.

16
00:01:02.898 --> 00:01:07.898
Another worm held Vern tightly.

17
00:01:07.899 --> 00:01:11.722
"I hope this works!" Ringo thought.

18
00:01:11.723 --> 00:01:21.289
At last the tunnel was warm.

19
00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:25.812
The worms let go!

20
00:01:25.813 --> 00:01:33.636
Everyone started to climb up.

21
00:01:33.637 --> 00:01:40.645
"Grab on, Tiny!" A hand suddenly reached down.

22
00:01:40.646 --> 00:01:46.836
Ringo grinned. "Thanks, Lucy!"

23
00:01:46.837 --> 00:01:51.681
Heat poles filled Bex's space truck.

24
00:01:51.682 --> 00:01:56.467
"Let's put these around your field, Vern," she said.

25
00:01:56.468 --> 00:02:02.257
"They will warm the soil."

26
00:02:02.258 --> 00:02:06.330
Soon the heat poles were in.

27
00:02:06.331 --> 00:02:10.807
A rumbling sound faded away.

28
00:02:10.808 --> 00:02:41.774
Ringo smiled. "The worms left!"

29
00:02:41.775 --> 00:02:44.731
Captain Nova looked happy.

30
00:02:44.732 --> 00:02:49.703
"You two did good work.

31
00:02:49.704 --> 00:02:52.418
I did something good too.

32
00:02:52.419 --> 00:02:59.774
I returned the flame peppers to the kitchen!"

